    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Horror Tale 2: Samantha \u2013 Continue the terrifying escape story and uncover new secrets behind the mysterious kidnapper.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the second chapter of the <i>Horror Tale</i> series, you awaken in a cold, locked prison. But you're not alone\u2014Samantha is with you. Work together, solve puzzles, and sneak past danger to escape the clutches of a terrifying villain who\u2019s been kidnapping children in Lakewitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Tom once again and unravel even darker secrets. The deeper you go, the more you\u2019ll discover about the masked kidnapper and his twisted plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Escape won\u2019t be easy. You'll need to stay quiet, search for hidden clues, solve escape-room puzzles, and explore creepy locations filled with 90s-style atmosphere, fear, and mystery.<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udd11 Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Original storyline</strong> with unexpected twists and <strong>animated cutscenes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Challenging <strong>puzzles</strong>, hidden objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd10 Explore <strong>5 atmospheric locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc64 <strong>Terrifying antagonis</strong>t with a growing backstory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude31 A tense, story-driven <strong>horror escape adventure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd2 Play as a kid in <strong>1990s America</strong> \u2013 sneak, survive, and discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Original retrowave soundtrack</strong> and immersive sound design<br><br>Come to help Samantha escape in this horror tale adventure!\u00a0\ud83d\udc7b</p></li></ul>",
